Package: velum-rec
Architecture: amd64
Depends: grub2-common, libcurl4, gpg
Description: Enterprise recovery tool for Velum OS
 VelumRec operates below the kernel, LSM, and VTA to repair damage
 that no other tool can reach. Requires Layer 3+ for standard mode,
 Layer 4 for aggressive mode.
